From 69625af98002097b1f22b41a73b0739c3e2504ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Fick <mfick@codeaurora.org>
Date: Fri, 2 Dec 2011 13:16:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Display and allow editing the user assigned to a change.

Add an "Assigned To:" row in the change status block at
the top of the change screen which displays to whom the
change is currently assigned.  Also add an edit icon to
the right of the username which pops of a dialog with
a listbox of the current reviewers (and the chagne owner)
along with a text field to type a comment about the
assignment and allowing the change to be assigned to a
new user.

